• Our integrated healthcare system consists of an international hospital and multiple clinics. We provide safe, reliable, and comprehensive healthcare services for all members of your family, and all different stages of life, including health management, ER, outpatient care, surgery, inpatient services and international medicine. Through our unique strategic collaboration with Massachusetts General Hospital, Jiahui Health brings leading global healthcare resources and China's most advanced medical expertise to your door. 
• The Jiahui Health app mainly serves Jiahui International Hospital. It focuses on linking online and offline services and providing one-stop medical services, with everything from appointment booking, to health declarations, to viewing report results and beyond. At the same time, it provides access to Jiahui deals and discounts on the Youzan platform, creating a user-centric, efficient, and convenient medical and health service platform.

 [Outpatient Appointment] Provides online, on-site emergency appointment service for users. Users can make, reschedule, and cancel appointments according to their own needs;
[Reports] Once they have been processed, users can view their reports easily and quickly on the Jiahui Health app; 
[Clinic Guide] Provide Card-type progress guide which is  clear Process and easy operation for users; 
[Discover] Provides users with video content and health-related knowledge, as well as information on deals and discounts, member rights and interests, and Jiahui activities, enhancing the user experience. At the same time, users can share info and links to products, services, and content.
[E-step] Use HealthKit and Health app data to sync your step count on E-step When you participate in “Jiahui Health E-walking”, walking and interacting with friends in a healthy way.
